    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(10th Level)</em></p><p>When you successfully banish, dispel, or suppress an effect:</p><p>You may spend <strong>1 additional Surge</strong> to apply <strong>Persistent Deletion</strong>.</p><p>Effect:</p><ul><li><p>The same effect cannot be reapplied to that target for 1 minute,<br /><strong>or</strong></p></li><li><p>It returns weakened (GM choice).</p></li></ul><p>If this contradicts established Precedent:</p><p>Gain +1 additional misfire risk.</p><p>Deletion is tolerated.</p><p>Contradicting canon is not.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
